 "note": [
  "Scripture is the Bíblia Livre para o Mundo (por_bpm), pasted by script; the English cites the NIV, and each label now names the Bíblia Livre. Where the English quotes part of a verse the Portuguese is cut to the same span. In ch. 12 the author’s “Three words” (after the NIV “Take care of my sheep”) becomes «Quatro palavras», to fit the Bíblia Livre «Pastoreie as minhas ovelhas».",
  "AI-translated (job #2779) in parallel chapters, then reconciled: section headings Quem ele foi / A sua visão do chamado pastoral / Uma oração; one form per book title (O Pastor Reformado, Hinos de Olney, O custo do discipulado). Possible slips in the English, translated as given: Newton’s ministry “across eight decades” (he was ordained in 1764 and died in 1807); the appendix labels Ezekiel 3:18 as 3:18–19. Awaiting native review."
 ],
